SUMMARY:Special Event: Vidura Bandara Rajapaksa: The Paradise Gothic Tour
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Vidura Bandara Rajapaksa returns with Paradise Gothic\, a sharp
 \, darkly funny new hour exploring immigration\, “radical” buddhism\, a
 nd the absurdities of attempting to build a life within late-stage capitali
 sm. With his trademark deadpan delivery and postcolonial wit\, Vidura takes
  on corporate tech culture\, spiritual burnout\, and the strange comedy of 
 trying to stay human in a world running by numbers. Smart\, subversive\, an
 d quietly explosive\; this is Vidura at his most fearless.\n\nThere is a tw
 o-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any
  food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchas
 ed in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nMana
 gement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility w
 ho they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://
 comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-vidura-bandara-rajapaksa-t
 he-paradise-gothic-tour-21899/
